After creating the hard link:

README: file, inode 2, links 2, size 2441 bytes
readme_link: file, inode 2, links 2, size 2441 bytes

After removing README:

readme_link: file, inode 2, links 1, size 2441 bytes

File contents verification:

cat readme_link | wc
48 336 2441

The experiment demonstrates that two hard links
can reference the same inode.

Removing README decreased the link count from
2 to 1, while the inode number and file size
remained unchanged.

The contents remained accessible through
readme_link.

